  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mandala Gardens Anchored in Rural School Yards - Piloting at Manhique Village (Gaza) by Inovagri Lda in partnership with Lavatsongo Association aims to demonstrate innovative farming systems to peasant communities, as a tool to adapt and mitigate climate change, combat economic vulnerability and malnutrition. To be set up in a very poor and dry area with serious water availability and very low soil fertility.</narrative>
